        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset PSKRDT, Modern Pismo Knob with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Pismo Knob with Round Rosette comes with all the convenience features and modern style you'd come to expected from this leader in door hardware, Kwikset. It is easy to install and with fit many standard pre-drilled doors. The Modern Pismo Knob with Round Rose is available in the most popular contemporary finish choices. Choose from  dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. The keyed entry function features Kwikset's SmartKey.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Pismo Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Pismo Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-6/7\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-13/32\" / Keyed Entry: 2-6/7\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pismo Knob with Round Rosette",
                "description": "The Pismo Knob with Round Rosette comes with all the convenience features and modern style you'd come to expected from this leader in door hardware, Kwikset. It is easy to install and with fit many standard pre-drilled doors. The Modern Pismo Knob with Round Rose is available in the most popular contemporary finish choices. Choose from  dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. The keyed entry function features Kwikset's SmartKey.",
